{"id":"vd-a2-the-forgotten-promise","level":"a2","n":37,"title":{"en":"I'm Really Sorry, Maya","vi":"Anh thật sự xin lỗi, Maya"},"summary":"Owen gõ cửa phòng em gái sau khi quên mất lời hứa làm núi lửa cùng em; lần này, xin lỗi thôi là chưa đủ.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-forgotten-promise","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Forgotten Promise","vi":"Lời hứa bị lãng quên"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[]},"cast":{"owen":{"name":{"en":"Owen","vi":"Owen"},"look":"teenboy","x":520,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1C22","skin":"#8D5A3B","skinShade":"#74472D","outfit":"tee","top":"#5E9E7A","topShade":"#4B8765"}},"maya":{"name":{"en":"Maya","vi":"Maya"},"look":"girl","x":1130,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#8D5A3B","skinShade":"#74472D","top":"#F08FB0","topShade":"#DC7398"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"owen","en":"Maya? Can I come in?","vi":"Maya? Anh vào được không?","ipa":["ˈmaɪə","kæn","aɪ","kʌm","ɪn"],"start":0.554,"end":2.224,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.344],[2,1.507],[3,1.643],[4,1.915]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"Go away.","vi":"Anh đi đi.","ipa":["ɡoʊ","əˈweɪ"],"start":3.014,"end":3.644,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,3.014],[1,3.227]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"Please. I want to apologize.","vi":"Làm ơn mà. Anh muốn xin lỗi.","ipa":["pliz","aɪ","wɑnt","tu","əˈpɑləˌdʒaɪz"],"start":4.434,"end":6.634,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,4.434],[1,5.271],[2,5.353],[3,5.584],[4,5.693]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"You promised to help me. I waited the whole afternoon.","vi":"Anh hứa giúp em rồi. Em đã chờ suốt cả buổi chiều.","ipa":["ju","ˈpɹɑməst","tu","hɛlp","mi","aɪ","ˈweɪtɪd","ðə","hoʊl","ˌæftɚˈnun"],"start":7.424,"end":11.894,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,7.424],[1,7.569],[2,8.235],[3,8.344],[4,8.697],[5,9.964],[6,10.168],[7,10.657],[8,10.766],[9,11.146]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"I know. I'm really sorry, Maya.","vi":"Anh biết. Anh thật sự xin lỗi, Maya.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","aɪm","ˈɹɪli","ˈsɑɹi","ˈmaɪə"],"start":12.684,"end":14.754,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,12.684],[1,12.72],[2,13.481],[3,13.63],[4,13.875],[5,14.337]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"It was my fault. I shouldn't have gone to Jake's house.","vi":"Là lỗi của anh. Anh không nên sang nhà Jake.","ipa":["ɪt","wɑz","maɪ","fɔlt","aɪ","ˈʃʊdənt","hæv","ɡɔn","tu","dʒeɪks","haʊs"],"start":15.294,"end":18.564,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,15.294],[1,15.348],[2,15.525],[3,15.742],[4,16.696],[5,16.764],[6,17.076],[7,17.239],[8,17.565],[9,17.701],[10,18.041]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"You forgot about me.","vi":"Anh quên mất em.","ipa":["ju","fɚˈɡɑt","əˈbaʊt","mi"],"start":19.354,"end":20.704,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,19.354],[1,19.503],[2,20.033],[3,20.372]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"Yes, I forgot. And that's not OK.","vi":"Ừ, anh đã quên. Và như thế là không được.","ipa":["jɛs","aɪ","fɚˈɡɑt","ənd","ðæts","nɑt","oʊˈkeɪ"],"start":21.494,"end":24.174,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,21.494],[1,21.782],[2,21.917],[3,22.921],[4,23.057],[5,23.369],[6,23.641]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"Why should I trust you now?","vi":"Sao giờ em phải tin anh chứ?","ipa":["waɪ","ʃʊd","aɪ","tɹʌst","ju","naʊ"],"start":24.964,"end":26.444,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,24.964],[1,25.187],[2,25.405],[3,25.513],[4,25.962],[5,26.098]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"Can I make it up to you?","vi":"Anh chuộc lỗi được không?","ipa":["kæn","aɪ","meɪk","ɪt","ʌp","tu","ju"],"start":27.234,"end":28.524,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,27.234],[1,27.365],[2,27.474],[3,27.745],[4,27.868],[5,28.071],[6,28.207]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"Tomorrow we can build the volcano. The whole day.","vi":"Mai anh em mình làm núi lửa. Cả ngày luôn.","ipa":["təˈmɑˌɹoʊ","wi","kæn","bɪld","ðə","vɑlˈkeɪnoʊ","ðə","hoʊl","deɪ"],"start":29.064,"end":32.354,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,29.064],[1,29.583],[2,29.746],[3,29.99],[4,30.357],[5,30.452],[6,31.634],[7,31.716],[8,31.974]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"The whole day? No games?","vi":"Cả ngày á? Không chơi game?","ipa":["ðə","hoʊl","deɪ","noʊ","ɡeɪmz"],"start":33.144,"end":35.844,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,33.144],[1,33.215],[2,33.555],[3,34.877],[4,35.203]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"No games, no phone. You can keep my phone until Monday.","vi":"Không game, không điện thoại. Em cứ giữ điện thoại của anh đến thứ Hai.","ipa":["noʊ","ɡeɪmz","noʊ","foʊn","ju","kæn","kip","maɪ","foʊn","ənˈtɪl","ˈmʌndi"],"start":36.634,"end":40.584,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,36.634],[1,36.809],[2,37.298],[3,37.516],[4,38.372],[5,38.481],[6,38.671],[7,38.942],[8,39.133],[9,39.622],[10,40.029]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"Promise?","vi":"Hứa nhé?","ipa":["ˈpɹɑməs"],"start":41.374,"end":42.034,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,41.374]]},{"speaker":"owen","en":"I promise. This time I really mean it.","vi":"Anh hứa. Lần này anh nói thật lòng.","ipa":["aɪ","ˈpɹɑməs","ðɪs","taɪm","aɪ","ˈɹɪli","min","ɪt"],"start":42.824,"end":45.244,"expression":"happy","gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,42.824],[1,42.824],[2,43.822],[3,43.986],[4,44.339],[5,44.488],[6,44.828],[7,45.1]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"OK. But I'm keeping your phone!","vi":"Được rồi. Nhưng em giữ điện thoại của anh đấy!","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","bʌt","aɪm","ˈkipɪŋ","jɔɹ","foʊn"],"start":46.034,"end":49.074,"expression":"happy","react":{"owen":"happy"},"timing":[[0,46.034],[1,47.444],[2,47.688],[3,47.919],[4,48.395],[5,48.585]]}],"words":[{"id":"promise","en":"promise","ipa":"ˈpɹɑməs","vi":"lời hứa; hứa hẹn","level":1},{"id":"fault","en":"fault","ipa":"fɔlt","vi":"lỗi; khuyết điểm; đứt gãy","level":1},{"id":"apologize","en":"apologize","ipa":"əˈpɑləˌdʒaɪz","vi":"xin lỗi","level":1},{"id":"forget","en":"forget","ipa":"fɚˈɡɛt","vi":"quên; quên mất","level":0},{"id":"whole","en":"whole","ipa":"hoʊl","vi":"toàn bộ; cả; nguyên vẹn","level":1},{"id":"trust","en":"trust","ipa":"tɹʌst","vi":"tin tưởng; sự tin cậy; quỹ tín thác","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Xin lỗi và đề nghị chuộc lỗi","pattern":"I'm really sorry. · It was my fault. · I shouldn't have… · C